{"id":"479282","name":"丝瓜排骨汤","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/479282/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"丝瓜","amount":"2根"},{"name":"排骨","amount":"800克"},{"name":"清水","amount":"适量"},{"name":"食用油","amount":"2汤匙"},{"name":"食盐","amount":"1克"},{"name":"鸡精","amount":"1克"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱叶","amount":"小许"},{"name":"平菇","amount":"小许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"排骨洗净。","img":"images/479282/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"冷水下锅。","img":"images/479282/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"烧开锅。","img":"images/479282/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"冷水洗净浮末。","img":"images/479282/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放电压力锅内。","img":"images/479282/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"加清水。","img":"images/479282/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"给电，选排骨。","img":"images/479282/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"煮好的排骨。","img":"images/479282/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"取丝瓜。","img":"images/479282/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"去皮洗净。","img":"images/479282/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"丝瓜切滚刀块。","img":"images/479282/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"平菇洗净，切小块。","img":"images/479282/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"葱叶切末，取排骨备用。","img":"images/479282/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"热锅冷油，油热放食盐。","img":"images/479282/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"放平菇翻炒。","img":"images/479282/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"放丝瓜翻炒。","img":"images/479282/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"丝瓜变软。","img":"images/479282/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"放排骨及排骨汤。","img":"images/479282/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"盖锅盖。","img":"images/479282/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"煮5分钟后放葱叶。","img":"images/479282/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"放鸡精。","img":"images/479282/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"装盘。","img":"images/479282/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/479282/step_23.jpg"},{"step":24,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/479282/step_24.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电压力锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}